spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Tiquanda Laboratory</b> is an abandoned, overgrown facility under a hill southeast of <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32886,32590,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32886, 32590, 7)</a>. It seems to be a plant incubator that have been taken over by hostile plant life. Only one sole survivor, a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Scientist\">Mad Scientist</a>, remains in the laboratory.<br/>\nThe laboratory is mostly inhabited by <a href=\"#/wiki/Carniphila\">Carniphilas</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Human\">Mutated Humans</a>. It is a good hunting spot for those who seek to complete a carniphila <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">task</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Human\"><img alt=\"Mutated Human\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mutated_Human_f81beb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Human\">Mutated Human</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">240</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">164 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">90 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=